# Day 24 – Image Generation Prompts

## What is an Image Generation Prompt?

Image Generation Prompts are prompts that describe what kind of image AI should create.

## Why is it useful?

The more details I provide, the better image get.
#mistake - It is useful because the more details we provide, the more accurate and higher-quality the AI-generated image becomes.

## Name 5 Uses of Image Generation

- Social Media Graphics
- Product Advertisements
- Logos
- Website Banners
- Posters

## My Own Image Prompt

Write one professional image generation prompt for a business.

Create a realistic image of a hot cup of coffee on a wooden table in a modern café.

Use warm morning sunlight.

Include soft background blur.

Camera angle: close-up.

High-quality, detailed, suitable for an Instagram advertisement.

## Reflection

What was the biggest thing you learned today?

I learned about  Image Generation Prompts.
#mistake  - I learned that giving clear details such as the subject, background, lighting, camera angle, and quality helps AI generate better images.


Extra information - Instead of writing only the image description, include a persona and a goal, just like you've learned in earlier lessons.

For example:

You are a professional product photographer.

Create a realistic image of a hot cup of coffee on a wooden table in a modern café.

Use warm morning sunlight and soft background blur.

Camera angle: close-up.

High-quality, detailed, suitable for an Instagram advertisement.

Ensure the image looks premium and attractive before presenting the final result.

This combines Persona + Task + Context + Quality + Goal, making your prompts even more powerful.
